<workout_file>
    <author>Domestique Library</author>
    <name>Sweet Spot (58min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 8min ramp from 50% to 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 89% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 89% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 89% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 89% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 89% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 81% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 6min @ 91% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 65% FTP | Steady: 6min @ 91% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 65% FTP | Steady: 6min @ 91% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 65% FTP | Steady: 6min @ 91% FTP | Cooldown: 5min @ 50% FTP</description>
